    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 128,
        "text": "Hi, I'm Mia. I'm a new student here, and I need to borrow some books. Could you explain how the self-checkout system works?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "8eaa77e52ccd74d9762ac761708e527c1f8a5d6280c4751dc695c7d9584e890c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 135,
        "sourceEnd": 379,
        "text": "Sure, Mia. I'm Tom, the library assistant. The system is quite simple. First, you need to scan your student card at the machine near the entrance. The machine will then ask you to place your books on the glass plate. One book at a time, please.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "a60b685fc665f71c804c268a7fd7b9786d60b8065cc56450e6b75eb5b2df96f9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 386,
        "sourceEnd": 456,
        "text": "Okay, scan my card, then put one book on the plate. What happens next?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "11e632ff71c0465728babb92f13df8885fee2009f4f9f39f301bada170327711",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 463,
        "sourceEnd": 693,
        "text": "After you place the book, the machine reads the barcode. You'll hear a beep, and the book's title will appear on the screen. Then you press the 'Borrow' button. The due date is shown automatically. Books can be kept for two weeks.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "a55b09c48294853351f93c987be3e1f27d834d436dc72ac5c590fad44285a66e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 700,
        "sourceEnd": 732,
        "text": "Two weeks. And can I renew them?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "9219f1d04dc965e86f92add7338640b22add4fab2abe80ba9ed4f987d3039765",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 739,
        "sourceEnd": 946,
        "text": "Yes, you can renew online once. But if someone else has reserved the book, renewal is not allowed. Also, the system is checked every morning by the staff, so if there's a problem, it's usually fixed quickly.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "e977ce55f3fbad1340b9979da31ea342c77fafe2b3d39dc16e199411a8d964d5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 953,
        "sourceEnd": 1013,
        "text": "What if I forget to check out a book? Will the alarm go off?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "296a5dac70b5139bc4ea151a7518bc5e4e61c283afab7b049ecfe204e9f7af30",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1020,
        "sourceEnd": 1166,
        "text": "Yes, the security gate will sound if a book is taken without being checked out. But don't worry—it's a common mistake. Just come back and scan it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "8483ee2c6ac85f5b26f8f74e0c22c939929675b46ed204916dcc0d849cde83e3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1173,
        "sourceEnd": 1209,
        "text": "Got it. And where do I return books?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "a96d92b75602bb6db93826be672767127d60596bfcbe4a35c8c5d24948311a6a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1216,
        "sourceEnd": 1433,
        "text": "The return slot is outside, next to the main door. Books are collected from there twice a day. Oh, wait—I said twice, but actually it's three times: morning, noon, and late afternoon. The times are posted on the wall.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "5434a150aadc612ba171f79cff9030ab82bc77800dffaf7514d7ec5c1df2de2b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1440,
        "sourceEnd": 1484,
        "text": "Thanks. One more thing: are there any fines?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "f9c4aaa8b535ca551ea1e2dafcd26d6b797a123a59e51a1b4006e710ce7560e4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1491,
        "sourceEnd": 1620,
        "text": "Yes, if a book is returned late, a fine of 50 pence per day is charged. But you can pay it at the front desk, not at the machine.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "ab93129f58fed41ee9108ef3558e31ad6bffde39f2864df6c2589a660bd1ba75",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1627,
        "sourceEnd": 1659,
        "text": "Great. I think I understand now.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "7551cf15c7452e407916403371411ebe06838eeba7418739d90f937d8cd65c98",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1666,
        "sourceEnd": 1790,
        "text": "Good. Remember, the machine is turned off for maintenance every Monday from 9 to 10 a.m., so please use the front desk then.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "4b20af4e6028e46a7a765b9d6c8c6f94f0881523b9e6730ab2655d1a11f87bda",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
